meta {
  name: Cancel Appointment
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/portal/appointments/{{portalAppointmentId}}/cancel
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Origin: {{portalOrigin}}
  X-CSRF-Token: {{portalCsrfToken}}
}

body:json {
  {}
}

docs {
  Cancels one of the session patient's upcoming active appointments (run Create Booking or List
  Appointments first; both store `portalAppointmentId`). Any appointment of the patient can be
  cancelled, provider-created ones too, with no cutoff. Needs the session cookie, the exact Origin
  and the CSRF token. The body is an empty object (or none): there is no reason field.

  204 on success: the appointment becomes CANCELLED with `cancelledBy=PATIENT`, its pending reminder
  is cancelled, and the patient and provider are notified. Every other case (not theirs, unknown,
  past, already cancelled, deleted, no consented patient for the session) is the same 404
  "Appointment not found".
}
